{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "sam-shop-api-collection",
    "name": "Sam Shop — All APIs",
    "description": "Tập hợp API Sam Shop microservices.\n\n**Cách dùng:**\n1. Import file này vào Postman.\n2. Chạy request **Auth → Get Token (customer1)** (hoặc staff1/admin1).\n3. Token tự lưu vào biến `access_token` — các request còn lại dùng Bearer.\n\n**Base URL (qua Gateway):** `http://localhost:8088`\n**Keycloak:** `http://localhost:8180`\n\n**Tài khoản dev:**\n| Username | Password | Role | userId |\n|----------|----------|------|--------|\n| customer1 | 123456 | USER | 1 |\n| staff1 | 123456 | EMPLOYEE | 2 |\n| admin1 | 123456 | ADMIN | 3 |\n\n**Internal APIs** (service-to-service): gọi trực tiếp port service (8082–8084), không qua Gateway — Gateway yêu cầu JWT cho mọi `/api/**` trừ GET products.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "gatewayUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8088" },
    { "key": "keycloakUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8180" },
    { "key": "productServiceUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8081" },
    { "key": "cartServiceUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8082" },
    { "key": "orderServiceUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8083" },
    { "key": "paymentServiceUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8084" },
    { "key": "access_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "userId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "productId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "categoryId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "cartItemId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "orderId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "paymentId", "value": "1" }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{access_token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth (Keycloak)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Token — customer1 (USER)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', json.access_token);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', '1');",
                  "  console.log('Token saved. userId=1');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "grant_type", "value": "password" },
                { "key": "client_id", "value": "sam-shop-ui" },
                { "key": "username", "value": "customer1" },
                { "key": "password", "value": "123456" }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{keycloakUrl}}/realms/sam-shop/protocol/openid-connect/token",
            "description": "Lấy JWT cho khách hàng. Chạy request này trước khi test Cart / Order / Payment (USER)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Token — staff1 (EMPLOYEE)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', json.access_token);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', '2');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "grant_type", "value": "password" },
                { "key": "client_id", "value": "sam-shop-ui" },
                { "key": "username", "value": "staff1" },
                { "key": "password", "value": "123456" }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{keycloakUrl}}/realms/sam-shop/protocol/openid-connect/token"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Token — admin1 (ADMIN)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', json.access_token);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', '3');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "grant_type", "value": "password" },
                { "key": "client_id", "value": "sam-shop-ui" },
                { "key": "username", "value": "admin1" },
                { "key": "password", "value": "123456" }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{keycloakUrl}}/realms/sam-shop/protocol/openid-connect/token"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Product Service (Gateway)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET — List products",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{gatewayUrl}}/api/products?search=&categoryId=",
              "host": ["{{gatewayUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "products"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "search", "value": "", "description": "Tìm theo tên (optional)" },
                { "key": "categoryId", "value": "", "description": "Lọc danh mục (optional)" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Public — không cần token."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET — Product by ID",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST — Create product",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Áo thun Sam Shop\",\n  \"price\": 199000,\n  \"description\": \"Mô tả sản phẩm\",\n  \"image\": \"https://example.com/image.jpg\",\n  \"quantity\": 100,\n  \"status\": \"ACTIVE\",\n  \"categoryId\": 1\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/api/products",
            "description": "Role: EMPLOYEE hoặc ADMIN."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "PUT — Update product",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Áo thun Sam Shop (cập nhật)\",\n  \"price\": 179000,\n  \"description\": \"Mô tả mới\",\n  \"quantity\": 80,\n  \"status\": \"ACTIVE\",\n  \"categoryId\": 1\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}",
            "description": "Role: EMPLOYEE hoặc ADMIN."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "DELETE — Delete product",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}",
            "description": "Role: EMPLOYEE hoặc ADMIN."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "PUT — Adjust stock",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"delta\": -5\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}/stock",
            "description": "Public trên product-service (dùng khi tạo đơn trừ kho). delta âm = giảm, dương = tăng."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET — List categories",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/api/products/categories"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST — Create category",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Thời trang\",\n  \"description\": \"Danh mục thời trang\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/api/products/categories",
            "description": "Role: EMPLOYEE hoặc ADMIN."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Cart Service (Gateway)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST — Add to cart",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"productId\": {{productId}},\n  \"quantity\": 1\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/api/cart/add",
            "description": "Role: USER. userId lấy từ JWT claim `userId`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET — Get cart by userId",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/api/cart/{{userId}}",
            "description": "Chỉ được xem giỏ của chính mình (userId trong path = userId trong token)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "PUT — Update cart item quantity",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"itemId\": {{cartItemId}},\n  \"quantity\": 2\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/api/cart/update"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "DELETE — Remove cart item",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/api/cart/remove/{{cartItemId}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Order Service (Gateway)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST — Create order",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"shippingAddress\": \"123 Nguyễn Huệ, Q1, TP.HCM\",\n  \"paymentMethod\": \"COD\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/api/orders",
            "description": "Role: USER. paymentMethod: `COD` | `ONLINE`. Giỏ phải có sản phẩm."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST — Create order (ONLINE)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"shippingAddress\": \"123 Nguyễn Huệ, Q1, TP.HCM\",\n  \"paymentMethod\": \"ONLINE\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/api/orders"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET — My orders",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/api/orders",
            "description": "Đơn hàng của user đang đăng nhập."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET — Order by ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET — All orders (staff)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/api/orders/all",
            "description": "Role: EMPLOYEE hoặc ADMIN. Dùng token staff1/admin1."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "PUT — Confirm order",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/confirm",
            "description": "Role: EMPLOYEE hoặc ADMIN. PENDING → CONFIRMED."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "PUT — Update order status",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"SHIPPING\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/status",
            "description": "status: PENDING | CONFIRMED | SHIPPING | COMPLETED | CANCELLED"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET — Revenue (admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/api/orders/revenue",
            "description": "Role: ADMIN only."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Payment Service (Gateway)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET — Payment by orderId",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/api/payments/order/{{orderId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "PUT — Confirm COD payment",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/api/payments/{{paymentId}}/confirm-cod",
            "description": "Role: EMPLOYEE hoặc ADMIN. Xác nhận đã thu tiền COD."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST — Initiate online payment",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"paymentId\": {{paymentId}}\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/api/payments/online/initiate",
            "description": "Mock: trả paymentUrl để mô phỏng cổng thanh toán."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST — Online payment callback",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"paymentId\": {{paymentId}},\n  \"success\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/api/payments/online/callback",
            "description": "Mock webhook: success true/false."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST — Retry online payment",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"orderId\": {{orderId}}\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/api/payments/online/retry",
            "description": "Thử lại sau khi thanh toán Online FAILED."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Internal APIs (direct service — no Gateway JWT)",
      "description": "Gọi thẳng từng service (port 8082–8084). Không cần Bearer token. Dùng khi debug hoặc mô phỏng gọi Feign giữa các service.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Cart — DELETE clear cart",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": "{{cartServiceUrl}}/api/cart/internal/{{userId}}/clear",
            "description": "Gọi sau khi tạo đơn thành công (order-service gọi qua Feign)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Order — PUT update payment status",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"paymentStatus\": \"PAID\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{orderServiceUrl}}/api/orders/internal/{{orderId}}/payment-status",
            "description": "paymentStatus: UNPAID | PAID | FAILED | REFUNDED"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Payment — POST create payment",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"orderId\": {{orderId}},\n  \"userId\": \"{{userId}}\",\n  \"amount\": 199000,\n  \"paymentMethod\": \"COD\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{paymentServiceUrl}}/api/payments/internal/create",
            "description": "order-service tạo payment khi checkout."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Health / Actuator",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Gateway — health",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/actuator/health"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Product — health",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{productServiceUrl}}/actuator/health"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Eureka — home",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "http://localhost:8761"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
